    <!--
        Nine more debtors, all in financial year 2025, for the exact figures that the functional test
        cases name and that 012 does not contain (functional test issues #113, #207, #237, #239,
        #240, #242). Every row is added here instead of editing 012. Like 012 it loads only outside
        production and outside the unit-test context.

        Year 2025 is deliberate: the 2026 views (the default demo view, and every officer's caseload)
        keep exactly the figures they had before. Only "All years" and the 2025 view change.
        See docs/TEST_SCENARIOS.md, section 2b, for what each row demonstrates.

          STU-100501-2025  NSFAS declined, owes R20 000 -> hardship award capped at R6 000  (FTC-24, TC-20)
          STU-100502-2025  NSFAS lapsed,   owes R10 000 -> hardship award R4 000 (40%)       (TC-20)
          STU-100503-2025  NSFAS pending, 2 missed, R12 000 -> holding arrangement 4 x R3 000 (TC-21)
          STU-100504-2025  Self-funded, 3 missed, R4 500, last receipt -> 3 x R1 500          (TC-23)
          STU-100505-2025  Self-funded, credit of R1 200 -> refund R1 200                    (TC-18)
          STU-100506-2025  Self-funded, 2 missed, owes R5 000  -> 3 instalments  (band edge)  (FTC-103)
          STU-100507-2025  Self-funded, 2 missed, owes R5 001  -> 4 instalments  (band edge)  (FTC-103)
          STU-100508-2025  Self-funded, 2 missed, owes R15 001 -> 6 instalments  (band edge)  (FTC-103)
          STU-100509-2025  Self-funded, 2 missed, owes R30 001 -> 8 instalments  (band edge)  (FTC-103)

        No arrangement is Defaulted, so rule 2 never fires; rows 1 and 2 match rule 3 first, row 3
        matches rule 4, row 5 matches rule 1, and the rest fall to rule 6.
    -->
    <changeSet id="017-01-seed-exact-figure-test-debtors-2025" author="student-debt-tracker" context="!prod and !test">

        <!-- Rule 3, capped: 40% of R20 000 is R8 000, so the R6 000 cap applies. -->
        <insert tableName="debtor">
            <column name="debtor_key" value="STU-100501-2025"/><column name="student_id" value="STU-100501"/><column name="name" value="Thandeka Zulu"/>
